@gatewayHost = http://localhost:5000
@username = admin
@password = admin321
@sessionToken = COLE_AQUI_O_SESSION_TOKEN

### Health check (público)
GET {{gatewayHost}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Login (público) - captura sessionToken
# @name gatewayLogin
POST {{gatewayHost}}/api/identity/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "{{username}}",
	"password": "{{password}}"
}

###

### Swagger UI sem token (esperado: 401)
GET {{gatewayHost}}/swagger/index.html

###

### Swagger JSON sem token (esperado: 401)
GET {{gatewayHost}}/swagger/catalog/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Swagger JSON com token (esperado: 200)
GET {{gatewayHost}}/swagger/catalog/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

###

### Swagger Orchestrator com token (esperado: 200)
GET {{gatewayHost}}/swagger/orchestrator/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
